      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would see if you can get by without this version of the function. Vulkan currently has both because before we couldn\u0027t use sk_sp on the resources. At one point I was slowly moving this over to the sk_sp version but that has been paused to do other refactors.\n\nAnyways if you can start with just sk_sp I think that would be better since it better describes the ownership.",
